# ---------------------------------------------------------------- people new in era 1
@char e1.edwin
name: Edwin Mott, census clerk
speaker: EDWIN
faction: district
about: Fifty-eight. Words the board's rules and walks the census round himself, door to door, with his son holding the lantern. Walter's father.

@char e1.walter
name: Walter Mott, junior clerk
speaker: WALTER
faction: district
about: Twenty-eight. Edwin's son. Carries the lantern on the census round and chalks a goat on every door they shut, head down, facing forward.

@char e1.josh
name: Josh Brack, the road post
speaker: JOSH
faction: district
about: Fifty-two. Keeps the post road and knows every face that comes down it. Will's father, who hits him on Fridays.

@char e1.george
name: George Orme, the mill
speaker: GEORGE
faction: millstreet
about: Fifty-two. Owns the mill and buys more off the exchange floor than anyone. Pays the hands by the sack.

@char e1.oskar
name: Dr Oskar Lind, the exchange's doctor
speaker: OSKAR
faction: chairmen
about: Fifty. Does rounds in the hands' barns because the exchange pays him to say who is fit.

@char e1.clara
name: Clara Lind
speaker: CLARA
faction: chairmen
about: Fourteen. Carries her father's bag, holds the reins of his gig, and watches who he passes.

@char e1.ashby
name: Clement Ashby, the Gazette
speaker: ASHBY
faction: chairmen
about: Forty-five. Sits in the gallery over the floor and wires the prices to Arlen.

@char e1.calley
name: Professor Edmund Calley, of Arlen
speaker: CALLEY
faction: chairmen
about: Sixty. The board's guest for the harvest. Has written a book about the hill people and met two of them.

@char e1.arn
name: Arn Sallis
speaker: ARN
faction: hesh
about: Thirty-four. A Hesh hand, down from the hill every harvest for eleven years.

@char e1.ketti
name: Ketti Sallis
speaker: KETTI
faction: hesh
about: Thirty. Arn's wife. Ties sheaves faster than any man on Orme's ground and is paid by the sack like them.

@char e1.davin
name: Davin Sallis
speaker: DAVIN
faction: hesh
about: Eight. Has a cough he has had since the barley.

@char e1.kel
name: Kel Tesk
speaker: KEL
faction: hesh
about: Fourteen. Old Tesk's son. Sweeps the mill floor at night for a penny.

@char e1.carrow
name: Old Carrow
speaker: CARROW
faction: millstreet
about: Fifty. A Tarn cottar on the Osby road. Bet's father. Plays the fiddle badly and knows every tune.

@char e1.lad
name: Furrowe's stable lad
speaker: LAD
faction: chairmen
about: Twelve or so. Sleeps over Abel's harness room. Sent with the key on census night, with what to say learned by heart on the walk down.

@char e1.corley
name: Corley, a hand
speaker: CORLEY
faction: hesh
about: A Hesh hand who ran off over Orme's ground on the morning of the frost and was fetched back by the collar. A wife and two little ones.

@char e1.haig
name: Haig, Orme's foreman
speaker: HAIG
faction: millstreet
about: Keeps the back store and the strap on the nail by the door.

